! ---------------------------------------------------------------
!   >>> THE COUNTER LEAVES THIS PAGE AT 220742.00. <<<
! Line 56 is "ST(BU,7),SCCW+.18($13)" at 220741.00, a FULL word, and
! there is no reservation, no forward SLC and no hole anywhere on this
! page.  So:
!   1. if p.178's line 1 is a located row, its heading-row LOCATION
!      field must read 220742;
!   2. if p.178 opens with a printed "SLC,$", that SLC's printed
!      LOCATION must be 220742.00;
!   3. p.178's first EMITTING row must be at 220742.00.
! Only a forward "SLC,(8)nnnn." would legitimately break this.
!
! AND THREE OF ITS LABELS ARE ALREADY READ OFF THIS PAGE'S BRANCHES.
! p.178 should carry, in its NAME column:
!      K OP OK   at 220743.00   (this page line 49, "BXE,K OP OK")
!      K PLUG1   at 220761.40   (this page line  7, "BZXL,K PLUG1")
